    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Property Shop is delighted to bring this bright and spacious first floor apartment to market. Located in the centre of Dungeagan Village, walking distance to Ballinskelligs blue flag beach and all the local amenities.\r\nIn a quiet cul de sac location, just off the beaten track close by is Tig Rosie - Sigersons Bar, Cill Rialaig Arts Centre, the Community Centre, Church and Scoil Mhicil National School.\r\nAccommodation features an open plan living/kitchen/dining with feature fireplace, two bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nA well located property a short drive to Waterville (12.3km), Cahersiveen (13.8km) and St. Finians Bay/The Glen (8.3km).\r\nAwaiting BER."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 1.5m x 1m - Hardwood entrance door, tiled floor, hardwood stairs to first floor\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding: 3.9m x 1.1m - Well lit with Velux window, tiled floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.2m x 2.9m - Solid timber floor\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: 3.2m x 1.45m - Fully tiled, corner entry shower, curved shower door, thermostatic power shower, w.c, wash hand basin\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.35m x 2.65m - Solid timber floor, window to front elevation, fitted wardrobe in recess 1.4m x 1.1m\r\n\r\nLiving/Kitchen/Dining: 8.8m x 3.7m - Window to front elevation, Velux window to rear elevation, fully fitted kitchen, feature fireplace with timber surround and cast iron insert, tiled floor, tiled splash back"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Great Location\r\nWalking distance to Beach\r\nAmple Parking\r\nGood Decor\r\nOpen Plan Living\r\nBright & Airy\r\nEasily Maintained\r\nShop & Pubs nearby"
      },
